{
  "title": "万里数据库携手运营商打造“智慧家庭” GreatDB助力美好生活",
  "description": "",
  "content": "<div class=\"newsxq\"> <div class=\"fhan\"> <div class=\"container\"> <p><a href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"javascript:history.back(-1);return false;\">返回<img src=\"../../../../static/home/images/tu14.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_nr\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"xqnr\"> <div class=\"xq_l\"> <div class=\"xq_rq\"><span>31</span><font>2024.10</font></div> <div class=\"xq_l_l\"> <h2>万里数据库携手运营商打造“智慧家庭” GreatDB助力美好生活</h2> <b>2024.10.31</b> <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-top: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">智慧家庭作为信息技术在家庭环境应用的落地实践，是以物联网、宽带网络为基础，依托移动互联网、云计算等新一代信息技术提供智能化服务及人与家庭设施的双向智能互动。</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">过往智慧家庭业务系统采用国外数据库，存在安全隐患，业务系统也存在单点故障风险。</span></span></span></p><p class=\"syl-page-br\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; height: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br/></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">为遵循IT国产化战略，稳步提升IT系统国产化程度，某运营商积极开展数据库国产替代工作，前期采用国内开源数据库GreatSQL替换MySQL数据库进行使用，完成了前期功能验证；后期确定采用性能及服务支撑更优的国产数据库，</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(193, 35, 50); --tt-darkmode-color: #C12332;\">将智慧家庭业务系统原先使用的MySQL数据库逐步替换为商业版数据库-万里安全数据库GreatDB</span></span>，降低对国外数据库的依赖，进而实现自主可控目标。</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><br/></span></p><p class=\"syl-page-br\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; height: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\"><br/></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(193, 35, 50); --tt-darkmode-color: #C12332;\">智慧家庭业务系统对数据库有哪些需求？</span></span></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(193, 35, 50); --tt-darkmode-color: #C12332;\">1. 数据库选型总体要求</span></span></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">能力：数据库需具备安全可靠能力</span></span></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">要求采用的国产数据库符合国家信创要求，具备高度的安全可靠能力，能保障信息安全和业务系统的安全性和自主性；</span></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">适配：保障应用灵活自“适应”</span></span></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">要求采用的国产数据库高度兼容MySQL，在数据迁移过程中，应用程序尽量不涉及改造，使系统整体迁移成本和迁移难度降至最低；</span></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">性能：数据库拥有高性能</span></span></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">目前业务高峰时段存在大量并发操作，偶尔会遇到数据库性能瓶颈，需要目标数据库具有更高效的数据并发处理能力；</span></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">安全：数据库需支持多种加密方式</span></span></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">系统涉及大量家庭信息，需确保数据在存储、传输和处理过程中的安全性，防止数据泄露、篡改等安全风险。</span></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\"><br/></span></span></p><p class=\"syl-page-br\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; height: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br/></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(193, 35, 50); --tt-darkmode-color: #C12332;\">2. 万里安全数据库GreatDB充分满足需求</span></span></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(193, 35, 50); --tt-darkmode-color: #C12332;\">高可靠</span></span>&nbsp;…</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">万里安全数据库GreatDB拥有跨机房的容灾部署能力、机房级的故障自动切换能力，能保障</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">任何故障场量下RPO＝0，RTO＜30S</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">，为将来业务系统可能进行的高可用扩展提供了技术基础；</span></span></p><p class=\"syl-page-br\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; height: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br/></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(193, 35, 50); --tt-darkmode-color: #C12332;\">MySQL兼容能力</span></span>&nbsp;…</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">GreatDB安全数据库具备</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">优秀的MySQL兼容能力</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">，能够保障业务系统从MySQL平滑、顺利迁移到GreatDB，同时可将迁移成本降到最低；</span></span></p><p class=\"syl-page-br\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; height: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br/></p><p style=\"box-sizi